  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-330\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 330</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <section class=\"paragraph\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>Le jour même de la publication sur l'application web de la commune de la liste des matières visées à l'article 285, § 1er, <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span></li>\n        </ol>, et des décisions visées à l'article 286, § 1er, l'autorité communale informe l'autorité de contrôle de leur publication.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>Lalinéa premier s'applique au centre public daction sociale, étant entendu que \" autorité communale \" se lit \" le centre public daction sociale \", \" article 285, § 1er, <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span></li>\n        </ol> \" se lit \" article 285, § 2, <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span></li>\n        </ol> \" et \" article 286, § 1er\" se lit \" article 286, § 2 \".</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</article>",
